    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reject gravity. Go fast.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high-speed physics-based speedrunning FPS inspired by 90's movement shooters and platformers.\u00a0Move like you've never moved before.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master gravity-defying physics-based movement with wall riding, loops, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the last city of Terragrad in a sprawling hub with events and challenges at every turn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through varied stages with flexible level design, letting you find the fastest route on your own terms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for challenging medals requiring skill and planning to earn, then take to the leaderboards and challenge the fastest players in the world (or just your friends!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit Mach 1 on the ground</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reject gravity. Go fast.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high-speed physics-based speedrunning FPS inspired by 90's movement shooters and platformers.\u00a0Move like you've never moved before.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master gravity-defying physics-based movement with wall riding, loops, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the last city of Terragrad in a sprawling hub with events and challenges at every turn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through varied stages with flexible level design, letting you find the fastest route on your own terms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for challenging medals requiring skill and planning to earn, then take to the leaderboards and challenge the fastest players in the world (or just your friends!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit Mach 1 on the ground</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Reject gravity. Go fast. A speedrunning FPS with gravity-defying physics-based movement. Find your own routes through stages and move like you've never moved before.",
